InitialConnection: `149`
ClientReason: `UnsupportedTransport`
ProtocolConstant: `UNSUPPORTED_TRANSPORT`

This issue occurs when the transport protocol is unsupported. In version 26.60, it is also displayed when the signaling server is inaccessible.